      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-01T12:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a link to documentation that explains this? It seems non-obvious even for UMA system because there might be pagetable stuff that could make this not true.",
      "revId": "00e3f1a8b9c9dfaf2c3e5e513a76d34d1fb3edcc",
