      "writtenOn": "2025-09-01T12:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is `MapWrite` added only when `isCacheCoherent`? It would be slower then if it were cache coherent, but wouldn\u0027t it always be faster than doing an intermediate copy?",
      "revId": "00e3f1a8b9c9dfaf2c3e5e513a76d34d1fb3edcc",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e4aef370_59667cfb",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/SharedBufferMemoryD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 118,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000861
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-02T22:17:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t believe that it is safe to write to WHITE_BACK memory on non-ccUMA architectures. We would need to flush the CPU cache before the device can read it.",
      "parentUuid": "e391301a_ce198f14",
      "revId": "00e3f1a8b9c9dfaf2c3e5e513a76d34d1fb3edcc",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
